*.epub
# Negation: the ebook-converter checks in a deterministic fixture EPUB under
# app/ebook-converter/samples/ as a stable target for image-preservation
# regression tests (Phase 2 of NEXT_UP_PLAN.md). The blanket *.epub rule
# above would otherwise ignore it.
!app/ebook-converter/samples/**/*.epub
!app/ebook-converter/samples/**/*.EPUB
# Phase 4.1: a SECOND, much smaller fixture EPUB under
# app/ebook-converter/e2e/fixtures/ serves as the Playwright E2E
# target. Keep it tracked for the same reason as the Phase 2 sample
# (deterministic byte-stable test fixture).
!app/ebook-converter/e2e/fixtures/**/*.epub
!app/ebook-converter/e2e/fixtures/**/*.EPUB

